## Delete User in Azure AD (Entra ID)

### Objective
To Delete a user account in Microsoft Entra ID.

### Steps Performed
1. Logged into Azure Portal
2. Navigated to Microsoft Entra ID
3. Selected Deleted Users → Click the user
4. clike the delete
6. Verified user Deletion

### Result
User account successfully Deleted.
